  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the fund is to support the implementation of the Nepal UN Development Assistance Framework (2018-2022), the four pillars of the UNDAF are Inclusive Economic Growth; Social Development; Disaster Risk Reduction, Climate Change Adaptation and Reconstruction; and Governance, Rule of Law and Human Rights.</narrative>
